  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To multiply powers of the same base, we add the exponents:\n\n$$\n{9}^{7}\\times {9}^{-7}={9}^{7-7}={9}^{0}\n$$\n\nAny number raised to the power of zero is equal to $1.$ So, \n\n$$\n{9}^{0}=1.\n$$",
